OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi to White House as
OL,4,Aleaders are photographed ahead of talks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump welcomes Xi Jinping to the
OL,7,FWhite House as part of the Chinese
OL,8,Fleader's historic three-day visit to
OL,9,Fthe US - here's what we've seen so far
OL,11,FXi will get a formal welcome on the
OL,12,FWhite House lawn, a military flyover,
OL,13,FOval Office talks and finally a grand
OL,14,Fstate banquet
OL,16,FAI - or 'super intelligence' as Trump
OL,17,Fcalls it - the Iran war, tariffs and
OL,18,FTaiwan are key issues, but major
OL,19,Fdisagreements likely won't be bridged
OL,20,Fat the pomp-filled talks, writes the
OL,21,FBBC's Daniel Bush
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
